<div class="wrap prose"><h1 class="ph">Daily install reports</h1>
<p class="answer">Every night we really install every listed agent add-on in each agent that supports it and publish the result here.{% if reports.length %} Latest: <a href="/reports/{{ reports[0].date }}/">{{ reports[0].date }}</a>, {{ reports[0].pass }}/{{ reports[0].total }} installs passed.{% endif %}</p></div>
{% include "nlembed.njk" %}
<div class="wrap prose"><div class="tw"><table class="matrix"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Add-ons</th><th>Installs passed</th><th>Newly broke</th><th>Fixed</th><th>New</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for r in reports %}<tr><th scope="row"><a href="/reports/{{ r.date }}/">{{ r.date }}</a></th><td>{{ r.addons }}</td><td class="tok">{{ r.pass }}/{{ r.total }}</td><td>{{ r.broke.length if r.broke else "–" }}</td><td>{{ r.fixed.length if r.fixed else "–" }}</td><td>{{ r.added.length if r.added else "–" }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<p class="muted">"–" means there was no earlier run to compare with. Missed nights are not backfilled. <a href="/how-we-test/">How we test</a></p></div>
